"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-qute_quarkus-qute-iteration-metadata-prefix]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-qute_quarkus-qute-iteration-metadata-prefix[`quarkus.qute.iteration-metadata-prefix`]##\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The prefix is used to access the iteration metadata inside a loop section.\n"
"\n"
"A valid prefix consists of alphanumeric characters and underscores. Three special constants can be used:\n"
"\n"
" - `<alias_>` - the alias of an iterated element suffixed with an underscore is used, e.g. `item_hasNext` and `it_count`\n"
" - `<alias?>` - the alias of an iterated element suffixed with a question mark is used, e.g. `item?hasNext` and `it?count`\n"
" - `<none>` - no prefix is used, e.g. `hasNext` and `count`  By default, the `<alias_>` constant is set.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_QUTE_ITERATION_METADATA_PREFIX+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid "icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-qute_quarkus-qute-iteration-metadata-prefix]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-qute_quarkus-qute-iteration-metadata-prefix[`quarkus.qute.iteration-metadata-prefix`]##"
msgstr ""

msgid "The prefix is used to access the iteration metadata inside a loop section."
msgstr ""

msgid "A valid prefix consists of alphanumeric characters and underscores. Three special constants can be used:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`<alias_>` - the alias of an iterated element suffixed with an underscore is used, e.g. `item_hasNext` and `it_count`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`<alias?>` - the alias of an iterated element suffixed with a question mark is used, e.g. `item?hasNext` and `it?count`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`<none>` - no prefix is used, e.g. `hasNext` and `count`  By default, the `<alias_>` constant is set."
msgstr ""

msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_QUTE_ITERATION_METADATA_PREFIX+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

msgid "`<alias_>`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
